# nr updates (crontab of the user that owns the .dmnd); both take the lock ~/.nr_dmnd.lock
# 04:30 GenBank/RefSeq daily files + PDB seqres + Swiss-Prot -> append (the only regular update)
# diamond_append.py (full nr release, all ~176 volumes, nr.000 alone 51 GB) only by hand:
# 30 3 * * * python3 $HOME/python/diamond_append.py >> $HOME/python/diamond_append.cron.log 2>&1
30 4 * * * python3 $HOME/python/nr_daily_delta.py >> $HOME/python/nr_daily_delta.cron.log 2>&1
# pathogenicity flags of the sequences of every new delivery; --pending catches up a day the cron missed
15 6 * * * python3 $HOME/python/pathogen_scan.py --pending >> $HOME/python/pathogen_scan.cron.log 2>&1
# 04:55 taxonomy names/lineage for the API and reports (no-op unless nodes.dmp changed)
55 4 * * * python3 $HOME/python/blast_taxon_refresh.py >> $HOME/python/blast_taxon_refresh.log 2>&1
# optional mail report: MAIL_TO=you@example.org SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.org MAIL_FROM=... MAIL_EHLO=...
